    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58805" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόμμῐ</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>gum</i>, <i><span class="en">
